    title: "The ModernBERT embedding path has no caller since Additional Files stopped using it: delete batch_embed_files and its helpers, and stop install-embeddings fetching a model nothing loads"  # 5ca8
    status: todo_hard  # 5ca8
    priority: 3  # 5ca8
