    not_duplicate_of: []  # 5ca8
    pr_ref:  # 5ca8
    description: "Residual of WI-patof-kujil-jikit-fobar-bokiz-mipar-mafan-mozub (2026-11-13). The sketch's Additional Files section took one of its three lists from an embedding ranking; measurement 0033 found it cost a quarter of a second per candidate, did not reproduce itself and found fewer README-linked files than role and depth do, and the list is now overview_rank.rank_overview_files (no model).\n\nWHAT IS LEFT WITH NO PRODUCTION CALLER, all in hypergumbo_core/sketch_embeddings.py unless noted:\n- embed_file_for_semantic_ranking, batch_embed_files, compute_5w1h_similarity\n- _extract_file_samples, _load_modernbert_model, _get_additional_files_probe_embeddings\n- _MODERNBERT_MODEL_NAME, _MODERNBERT_TRUNCATE_DIM, and the per-file embedding cache helpers (_compute_file_hash, _load_cached_embedding, _save_cached_embedding) if nothing else reads them: check each caller before deleting\n- the additional-files probe embeddings in _embedding_data.py and their generator in scripts/compute_probe_embeddings.py\n- EMBEDDING_MODELS still lists the ModernBERT model, so hypergumbo install-embeddings downloads it and no command loads it\n\nADDITIONAL_FILES_PROBES (the three paragraphs) STAYS: overview_rank reads it as its BM25 query. Move it to overview_rank when the embedding code goes.\n\nALSO: tests of the deleted functions (test_sketch.py batch_embed_files block, test_embedding_file_samples_determinism.py, the ModernBERT halves of test_embeddings_offline_degradation.py and test_embeddings_never_fetched_at_runtime.py), docs/CITATIONS.md's ModernBERT entry, docs/hypergumbo.io-allowlist.yaml entries for the deleted sites, the user-cache embeddings directory that existing installs hold (say what happens to it), and docs/example-output.md, whose recorded run shows the removed \"Embedding additional files\" phase.\n\nNOT IN SCOPE: the other embedding model (_EMBEDDING_MODEL, unixcoder) and its users: README description extraction and embedding-based config discovery and extraction. Whether those earn their cost is a separate question; measurement 0033 says nothing about them.\n\nGENERALITY (owner, 2026-11-13): nothing here is specific to a repository or a language; the acceptance is that install-embeddings fetches only models some command loads, checked by a test over EMBEDDING_MODELS and the loaders."  # 5ca8
    fields: {}  # 5ca8
