  message: "Done in the same PR as its parent, #2170 (dev ad78277020), because check-allowlist-commands refused the first commit: the I/O allowlist listed the ModernBERT loader and safety_zones.cache_save_npy as reached by `sketch`, and they no longer were. Removed: embed_file_for_semantic_ranking, batch_embed_files, compute_5w1h_similarity, _extract_file_samples, _load_modernbert_model, the probe-embedding loader, _compute_file_hash / _load_cached_embedding / _save_cached_embedding / _get_cache_dir, safety_zones.cache_save_npy, the precomputed 5W1H vectors and their half of scripts/compute_probe_embeddings.py, their tests, the two allowlist entries, the self-catalogue row and the test-only-reachability baseline entry. EMBEDDING_MODELS is ('microsoft/unixcoder-base',). ACCEPTANCE as filed: packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/test_embeddings_never_fetched_at_runtime.py::test_install_fetches_only_models_a_loader_loads checks that every model in EMBEDDING_MODELS is one a loader passes to the cache-only constructor; check-io-allowlist and check-allowlist-commands pass (308 sites, 255 entries). The probe paragraphs moved to overview_rank.OVERVIEW_PROBES. NOT DONE, and small: cache-status still reports an embeddings/ directory when an older version left one (nothing writes there now; cache-clear removes it with the rest), and docs/example-output.md is a recorded run from 11-09 that still shows the removed phase."  # 2dda
